<para>Not thread-safe. The caller must ensure exclusive access to <computeroutput>schema_mgr</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>version_mgr</computeroutput> during <ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_in_place_schema_migrator_1a76ed86919131e7f4343c7406a286689a" kindref="member">apply()</ref>.</para>
